msgstr "出口 %s：IPv6 DNS 地址 %s 须为 IPv6 地址（可选 [地址]:端口），已忽略"

msgid "net.bridge.bridge-nf-call-iptables is enabled, so exit DNS redirection will not take effect; set it to 0"
msgstr "系统开启了 net.bridge.bridge-nf-call-iptables，会导致出口 DNS 转发不生效，请将其设为 0"

msgid "Optional. Plain DNS queries from matched devices for matched domains are sent to this server through this exit, for example the gateway address or 8.8.8.8. The IPv6 DNS server is found automatically. The server must return real addresses, not fake-ip. Local names such as .lan are always resolved by this router."
msgstr "可选。命中分流的设备查询命中的域名时，明文 DNS 查询经此出口发往该服务器，例如网关地址或 8.8.8.8。IPv6 DNS 服务器自动获取。该服务器必须返回真实地址，不能使用 fake-ip。.lan 等本地名称始终由本路由器解析。"

msgid "The DNS server is checked at the check interval by resolving the check domain through this exit. Two failures in a row mark it as failed; two successes mark it as recovered."
msgstr "按检测间隔经此出口解析检测域名。连续 2 次失败判为不可用，连续 2 次成功判为恢复。选择改用备用出口的 DNS 时，沿故障切换链依次查找可用的 DNS，都不可用时使用主路由 DNS。"

msgid "Applies when no exit in the fallback chain can carry IPv6 DNS queries, for example when IPv6 is not handled or the IPv6 check failed. Rejecting makes devices retry over IPv4 at once, so both answers come from the same exit."
msgstr "故障切换链中没有出口能转发 IPv6 DNS 查询时生效，例如出口不处理 IPv6 或 IPv6 检测失败。选择拒绝时，设备会立即改用 IPv4 查询，解析结果来自同一出口。"

msgid "A domain that this DNS server should be able to resolve. Defaults to www.google.com."
msgstr "该 DNS 服务器应能解析的域名，默认为 www.google.com。"

msgid "Many ImmortalWrt routers redirect all DNS queries to themselves. If the gateway resolves through a plain DNS server such as 8.8.8.8, its queries would be answered by this router instead. Keep this enabled unless that redirection is wanted."
msgstr "ImmortalWrt 默认将局域网内的 DNS 查询全部重定向到本路由器。若网关使用 8.8.8.8 等明文 DNS 服务器解析，其查询会改由本路由器应答。除非需要这种重定向，否则请保持开启。"

